        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Should a bricklayer be required by law to accompany any Safety Inspector, city, state or federal (O.S.H.A.) on a Safety Inspection on the job site, he shall do so with pay; however, the individual bricklayer shall be the Foreman or his designee and the Steward on the job shall be informed of any unsafe violations found pertaining to the masonry work.",
